      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat Version: 2020.1.1p3\nUnity Version: 2018.4.20.f1\nSDK Version: VRCSDK2-2020.04.17.11.34\nDescription of Bug: If Spawned Prefab got Dynamic Bone, it does not work.\nStep to reproduce: Make prefab (which include dynamic bone on object) to assign to VRC_Trigger+SpawnObject.\nSample World: wrld_0d1fae89-d2fc-4201-9916-598b89dd0f55\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0d1fae89-d2fc-4201-9916-598b89dd0f55\n*Both object placed on the world are same file. (Expect spawned object made as prefab of SetGameObjectActive)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
