  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This bug was reported to me a few weeks ago, so a prior patch around 3 weeks to a month ago, introduced an issue where my Fishing world no longer works.\n\nDynamic Bone on objects in a world, works. It also works if you put it on an object that can be toggled on and off. However, if you put dynamic bone on an object that you spawn into the world using 'spawn object' trigger...   it will not work.\n\nMy fishing poles are spawned into the world dynamically using 'spawn object', and now the fishing line doesn't fall, it is just frozen in place. Due to this reason, the fishing pole no longer works, as you can't get the hook under the water unless you are standing under water.",
